1
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:10,957
That hallway light's been flickering all week.

2
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:18,794
Who puts out a white cloth with red wine?

3
00:00:18,944 --> 00:00:19,989
It's going to get ruined.

4
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:30,583
Bit sad, no? It's my birthday.

5
00:00:39,800 --> 00:00:41,094
Who posted this?

6
00:00:41,044 --> 00:00:42,391
Tey from the office.

7
00:00:42,441 --> 00:00:44,316
Repost it. Now I can die happy.

8
00:00:49,600 --> 00:00:50,811
Did it crack?

9
00:00:50,661 --> 00:00:51,832
It's fine, it's fine.

10
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:59,635
Thanks for coming... Martin, thanks for the house... Dao... the one who knows me best.

11
00:01:01,685 --> 00:01:04,740
And Andy, drinks tonight are on Andy. He still owes me.

12
00:01:04,790 --> 00:01:05,651
Cheers!

13
00:01:15,600 --> 00:01:17,648
What's in there, a brick?

14
00:01:17,698 --> 00:01:19,301
Girl stuff.

15
00:01:24,500 --> 00:01:25,892
Who spilled wine?

16
00:01:25,942 --> 00:01:27,186
I'm only just opening it.

17
00:01:27,136 --> 00:01:28,758
Nobody's even poured yet.

18
00:01:32,800 --> 00:01:35,013
Happy birthday, happy birthday

19
00:01:36,663 --> 00:01:38,376
I wish tonight... never ends.

20
00:01:39,426 --> 00:01:40,614
Careful what you wish for.

21
00:01:47,800 --> 00:01:53,143
Game: if we were stuck in this room and one of us had to 'go'... who? On three.

22
00:01:53,193 --> 00:01:54,646
One, two, three!

23
00:01:55,896 --> 00:01:56,879
Fair.

24
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:07,052
Déjà vu.

25
00:02:07,502 --> 00:02:08,765
Coincidence.

26
00:02:17,700 --> 00:02:19,450
Ow! Who hit me?!

27
00:02:21,300 --> 00:02:22,895
Nobody touched you.

28
00:02:22,945 --> 00:02:24,314
We're two meters away.

29
00:02:35,500 --> 00:02:37,312
A bit dramatic, aren't you? A real movie star.

30
00:02:39,600 --> 00:02:41,851
You know exactly what you've done.

31
00:02:41,801 --> 00:02:42,857
Martin...

32
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:54,561
It came first... the blood came before the hit.

33
00:02:54,811 --> 00:02:56,105
What are you talking about?

34
00:02:56,355 --> 00:02:59,697
The wine too. It stained before the glass fell... the effect comes before the cause.

35
00:03:05,500 --> 00:03:06,662
I'm out.

36
00:03:08,400 --> 00:03:09,851
Wait! ...The window.

37
00:03:21,200 --> 00:03:22,187
Who has a gun?

38
00:03:23,037 --> 00:03:23,993
WHO HAS A GUN?!

39
00:03:29,200 --> 00:03:30,544
Someone's outside.

40
00:03:36,500 --> 00:03:37,832
The curtain has a hole too...

41
00:03:38,682 --> 00:03:40,995
That means when the gun goes off, the curtains will be closed.

42
00:03:41,645 --> 00:03:43,450
We never open them again.

43
00:03:48,600 --> 00:03:49,890
I'm calling the police.

44
00:03:49,840 --> 00:03:53,505
And tell them what? That the future gave you a nosebleed?

45
00:03:53,655 --> 00:03:55,410
Dao's right. Don't call yet.

46
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:05,483
Nobody's knocked it over yet.

47
00:04:10,400 --> 00:04:12,749
Then I won't touch anything sharp. Nothing.

48
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:21,914
So why don't you have a mark, Dao?

49
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:28,459
If someone's going to shoot, the gun is in this room. We search everyone... starting with you, Do.

50
00:04:32,500 --> 00:04:33,377
Give that back!

51
00:04:34,527 --> 00:04:37,306
Don't bother reading it. I already know.

52
00:04:38,956 --> 00:04:40,456
Since... when?

53
00:04:40,906 --> 00:04:41,936
Last month.

54
00:04:50,500 --> 00:04:53,132
You were going to propose... at my birthday, in front of me?

55
00:04:53,782 --> 00:04:55,749
Dao, tell him who you choose.

56
00:04:57,199 --> 00:04:58,655
She chose me a long time ago.

57
00:05:05,800 --> 00:05:07,100
Do me last.

58
00:05:07,150 --> 00:05:08,035
No. You next.

59
00:05:12,685 --> 00:05:13,553
You were going to run?

60
00:05:14,203 --> 00:05:15,570
You pushed me.

61
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:25,810
No.

62
00:05:26,460 --> 00:05:28,376
Andy, you believe me, right?

63
00:05:28,826 --> 00:05:30,966
Nobody believes anybody any more.

64
00:05:39,000 --> 00:05:40,445
It's for protection.

65
00:05:40,495 --> 00:05:41,787
From who?

66
00:06:02,600 --> 00:06:04,315
Let's just get it over with.

67
00:06:06,400 --> 00:06:07,449
What if you miss?!

68
00:06:20,500 --> 00:06:21,976
It's done... that was it.

69
00:06:23,026 --> 00:06:25,681
I'm opening the door. I don't care who's out there.

70
00:06:42,000 --> 00:06:43,489
I... I haven't died yet.

71
00:06:50,000 --> 00:06:51,046
It's not empty.

72
00:06:55,600 --> 00:06:57,005
Stay back! All of you.

73
00:06:57,255 --> 00:06:58,758
Do, nobody wants to—

74
00:06:58,408 --> 00:07:00,355
You were getting on a plane tomorrow morning, Andy.

75
00:07:00,805 --> 00:07:02,675
You brought a ring to my birthday.

76
00:07:03,225 --> 00:07:05,025
And you... you brought a gun.

77
00:07:29,000 --> 00:07:30,346
It's open, Do. Go on.

78
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:47,675
Well...

79
00:07:48,725 --> 00:07:49,751
...let's sit down.
